- Reuse the same split/fold/query manifests for every baseline and candidate comparison.

{% if task_type in ["retrieval", "rag"] %}
## Retrieval Baseline Protocol

- Build BM25 first over the canonical cleaned corpus.
- Record chunking grid candidates before tuning (for example token-aware 256/512/1024 with 10-20% overlap).
- Choose chunk size/overlap on dev queries only, then freeze it before test reporting.
- Evaluate a fixed top-k grid such as k=3/5/10/20 with Recall@k, MRR, and source-hit rate.
- Keep generation out of the baseline until retrieval reaches the target Recall@k.
- Add reranking only as a later controlled change; rerank a recorded candidate pool such as top-50 to final top-k.
