## Leakage Checks

- Check whether target labels or future information appear in input features.
- Check duplicate or near-duplicate samples across train / validation / test.
- Keep preprocessing fit only on train data.

## Imbalance Handling

{% if has_class_imbalance %}
- Class imbalance is expected. Track per-class recall and confusion matrix.
- Try class weights or balanced sampling after the first clean baseline.
{% else %}
- No known class imbalance yet. Still inspect label distribution before training.
{% endif %}

## Data Decision Gate

Do not run advanced model training until dataset split, labels, leakage checks, and baseline metric are documented.
